---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact David Thiele | Production, Mixing, Mastering & Sync Licensing"
  description="Get in touch with David Thiele about production, mixing, mastering, or music licensing for film, TV, and advertising."
>

<style>
.page-hero{background:var(--bg);padding:160px 28px 70px;text-align:center}
.page-hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,54px);font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:16px}
.page-hero p{font-size:17px;color:var(--text-body);max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.7}
.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:64px}
.contact-card{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:40px 36px;text-align:center;transition:box-shadow 0.3s,border-color 0.3s}
.contact-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);border-color:rgba(212,166,74,0.35)}
.contact-card h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:10px}
.contact-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:26px}
.info-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.info-box{background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:28px 24px;text-align:center}
.info-box h3{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:10px}
.info-box p{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.65}
@media(max-width:860px){.contact-grid,.info-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<div class="page-hero">
  <span class="tag-line" style="justify-content:center">Contact</span>
  <h1>Let's make something.</h1>
  <p>Whether it's a sync inquiry, a production project, or just a question — reach out below.</p>
</div>

<section class="sec sec-1" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-card reveal">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>The best way to reach me. Tell me a bit about the project and I'll follow up.</p>
        <a href="mailto:david@macawish.com?subject=Music%20Inquiry" class="btn-gold">david@macawish.com</a>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card reveal">
        <h2>Phone</h2>
        <p>Prefer to talk it through? Call or text and I'll get back to you.</p>
        <a href="tel:5035679858" class="btn-gold">(503) 567-9858</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="info-row">
      <div class="info-box reveal">
        <h3>Sync &amp; Licensing</h3>
        <p>THEEL GOOD MUSIC (BMI) — one-stop, pitch-ready tracks for supervisors and editors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box reveal">
        <h3>Production</h3>
        <p>Full production, mixing &amp; mastering across pop, rock, Americana, soul, country &amp; hip hop.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box reveal">
        <h3>Turnaround</h3>
        <p>Pricing and timeline discussed once I understand the scope of your project.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
